sequenceDiagram
  actor user as User
  participant fe as React Frontend
  participant api as C-Sharp Backend
  participant agent as Python Agent
  participant llm as OpenAI

  user ->> fe: Ask copilot question
  fe ->> api: POST /api/copilot/chat
  activate api
  api ->> agent: Forward request
  activate agent
  agent ->> llm: Chat completion
  activate llm
  llm --) agent: Stream tokens
  deactivate llm
  agent -->> api: MetaEvent: tool_result
  note right of api: Build MetaEvents from tool outputs
  agent -->> api: MetaEvent: layout_card
  deactivate agent
  api -->> fe: SSE: CUSTOM event
  deactivate api
  fe -->> user: Render AI response
  note right of user: Intercept and render cards